        "message": "fix(launcher_test): danh dau posix cho dot bien r1252_ghi_de_dich_truc_tiep (#1272)\n\nlauncher-windows.yml do tren master (run 42360967762 @27fd808, 42398808503 @c6afde6):\nduy nhat `r1252_ghi_de_dich_truc_tiep SAI giet 0/1`. Dot bien sua dong os.replace(...,\nsrc_dir_fd=dfd, dst_dir_fd=dfd) trong nhanh `if _CO_DIR_FD:` cua _ghi_tep_0600.\n\nA1 do tren tra-luat-win (Python 3.12.10, @27fd808): os.open/os.unlink khong trong\nsupports_dir_fd, khong O_NOFOLLOW/O_DIRECTORY => _CO_DIR_FD = False; ca dich\nr1252_ghi_bang_chung_an_toan QUA; dot bien nhu master tai hien `SAI giet 0/1`.\n=> nhanh dir_fd la ma khong chay tren Windows; gan nhan (\"posix\", ly do) theo co che\nco san (muc[3], tien le ban_chup_de_ho_quyen).\n\nLinux: dot bien van giet 1/1 (do tap trung dung 1 muc, DOT_BIEN_HOOK/HARNESS rong);\nmo phong LA_WINDOWS=True => KHONG DO DUOC. launcher_test 397/397 (bo qua 2 nhu nen);\nruff F delta 0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015GtxraXfMD1t2FJLzzGDr4",
